	text: [
		"Stabbing oneself over and over again is not the most efficient way of releasing life essence. ",
		"",
		"With a bit of meditation in a §6tranquil§r place, this can be §6enhanced§r greatly. ",
		"",
		"The §6Incense Altar§r is a complex §6multiblock§r structure that improves the §6sacrifical dagger§r. ",
		"",
		"Being §6near§r the incense altar will imbue the sacrificial dagger §6temporarily§r, indicated by its change in appearance.",
		"",
		"Upon use of the sacrifical dagger (near a §6blood altar§r), it will consume §6most§r of ones life essence in §61 stab§r, as well as provide §6bonus§r life essence. ",
		"",
		"Afterwards, one has to meditate near the incense altar again.",
		"",
		"The bonus the altar provides can be seen by holding a§6 Divination Sigil§r while looking at it.",
		"",
		"By §6default§r, the incense altar provides a §620%§r bonus."
